e snapshot, from a Poisson model of past arrivals (need there, team strength and trajectory, turnover, expected departures). Draft picks, two-way call-ups and signings from outside the league are not counted.","Targets: players on other teams who would upgrade the team's weakest regular slot in the pool (its second guard or forward, its centre), ranked by their chance of joining: the chance the player moves x the chance this team is where they go (a conditional logit on past moves). An estimate from on-field value and history, not news."],"updated_at":"2026-10-31T00:33:15Z","league":"wnba","roster_source":"box_scores","recent_rates":{"seasons":[2023,2024,2025],"next":0.505,"deadline":0.022,"note":"League rates over the last three labelled seasons, for context when a block is not published."},"team_names":{"9":"New York Liberty","2":"Cleveland Rockers","13":"Sacramento Monarchs","6":"Los Angeles Sparks","1":"Charlotte Sting","15":"Utah Starzz","4":"Houston Comets","11":"Phoenix Mercury","3":"Dallas Wings","16":"Washington Mystics","8":"Minnesota Lynx","10":"Orlando Miracle","5":"Indiana Fever","7":"Miami Sol","132052":"Portland Fire","14":"Seattle Storm","98":"EAST","99":"WEST","18":"Connecticut Sun","17":"Las Vegas Aces","19":"Chicago Sky","20":"Atlanta Dream","21":"CHINA","22":"Poland","24":"Great Britain","23":"JX Sunflowers","25":"Japan","17475":"JAPAN","17473":"Brazil","17472":"Australia","104959":"Puerto Rico","129689":"Golden State Valkyries","130927":"Toyota Antelopes","-1":"Valkyries/Aces","-2":"TBD","131935":"Toronto Tempo","17476":"NIGERIA"}}